OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny
OL,6,Fremaining showers will quickly clear
OL,7,Fto leave a dry evening with some sunny
OL,8,Fspells. The rest of the night will
OL,9,Fthen remain dry with clear periods.
OL,10,FTurning rather chilly.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA dry and bright morning with
OL,13,Fsunny intervals, with increasing areas
OL,14,Fof cloud. A dry afternoon with sunny
OL,15,Fintervals turning hazier. A few spots
OL,16,Fof rain possible during late evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
