OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FBecoming unsettled from Monday, with
OL,7,Frain spreading northwards, at times
OL,8,Fheavy and persistent. Further spells
OL,9,Fof rain or showers are likely on
OL,10,FTuesday and Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
